Cell["\<\
Noncollinear order: P4 generates four in-plane moments from one seed. \
Repeating the cell shows sixteen atoms with moments along +x, -x, +y, and -y:\
\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"65bbb4b6-c4d8-4db7-8914-915d7c873f78"],

